    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n11016" root="خطف" body-key="x">
    
      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اختطف</span></b> ; and its variations <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَطَّفَ</span> and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِطِّفَ</span>; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يِخِطِّفُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَخِطِّفُ</span>, variations of its
aor.: see 1, in seven places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَأَنَّهُ يَخْتَطِفُ فِى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَشْيِهِ عُنُقَهُ</span>, said of a swift camel, means <i>As
though he were straining,</i> or <i>stretching,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَجْتَذِبُ</span>,)
<i>in his going along, his neck.</i> (S.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also 4.

